sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant Web as infrastructure/web
    participant UC as application/use case
    participant Port as domain/ports/out
    participant Adapter as infrastructure/client
    participant Core as Core Service
    participant Render as infrastructure/render
    participant Mail as infrastructure/mail

    Client->>+Web: GET /ui/... (data, pdf o xlsx)
    Web->>+UC: Ejecutar caso de uso
    UC->>+Port: cargar datos del período
    Port->>+Adapter: delegar
    Adapter->>+Core: OpenFeign
    Core-->>-Adapter: DTOs
    Adapter-->>-Port: modelos de dominio
    Port-->>-UC: fuente
    UC->>UC: calcular contenido (sin frameworks)
    UC->>+Render: render(content, path)
    Render-->>-UC: archivo generado
    UC->>+Port: efectos (letra, auditoría)
    Port->>Adapter: delegar
    Adapter->>Core: POST/PUT
    UC-->>-Web: ReportFile
    Web-->>-Client: JSON / attachment / inline

    opt Generación asíncrona de PDF (bonoDependencia)
        Client->>Web: POST /ui/bonoDependencia/pdf/...
        Web->>UC: iniciar job en segundo plano
        Web-->>Client: 202 + jobId
        Client->>Web: GET /pdf/job/{jobId}
        Web-->>Client: estado, procesados/total y legajos fallidos
        Client->>Web: GET /pdf/job/{jobId}/file
        Web-->>Client: PDF consolidado terminado
    end

    opt Envío por email
        Client->>Web: sendBono
        Web->>UC: SendBonoUseCase
        UC->>Mail: enviar adjunto
        Mail-->>UC: ok
        UC->>Port: marcar bonoEnviado
    end
